claim.claim-text:
an elongated body (20);
the elongated body including a connection facility adapted to connect to the archery projectile;
the elongated body including a microcontroller (60);
the elongated body including a sensor facility in communication with the microcontroller and operable to detect a flight state;
the elongated body including a transmitter (50) in communication with the microcontroller, the transmitter having a multiple power digital amplifier (56) and operable to broadcast a plurality of data signals after the flight state has been detected, the plurality of data signals including information generated by the sensor facility; and
wherein a first of the plurality of data signals is transmitted at a first power level and a second of the plurality of data signals is transmitted at a second power level, the first power level distinct from the second power level.

location information;
direction information;
temperature information;
energy status information; and
movement information.
